    "body": "The maintainer chose to split this issue in two parts (question dialog, 2026-11-14: \"Split in two\").\n\n- Part 1 is issue 1720: the stored flip, the undoable command, the three buttons and the MCP tool. The post refuses a flipped WCS by name.\n- Part 2 is this issue: carry the flip into the posted program. This includes coordinate signs, the swap of `G2` and `G3` with the arc centre signs, the swap of `G41` and `G42`, and for a Z flip the tool axis, heights and retract direction. Golden NC tests must pin arcs and cutter compensation. This work shares the frame design of issue 760.\n\nPart 2 starts after part 1 merges.\n",
